     The ccaappssiiccuumm hheellppeerrss are a set of a inline functions which simplify modi‐
     fying programs to use Capsicum.  The goal is to reduce duplicated code
     patterns.  The ccaappssiiccuumm hheellppeerrss are part of lliibbccaappssiiccuumm but there is no
