     ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttrreeaamm() restricts capabilities on _f_d to only those needed by
     POSIX stream objects (that is, FILEs).

     These flags can be provided:

           CAPH_IGNORE_EBADF  Do not return an error if file descriptor is in‐
                              valid.
           CAPH_READ          Set CAP_READ on limited descriptor.
           CAPH_WRITE         Set CAP_WRITE on limited descriptor.

     ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttddiinn(), ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttddeerrrr() and ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttddoouutt() limit
     standard descriptors using the ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttrreeaamm function.

     ccaapphh__lliimmiitt__ssttddiioo() limits stdin, stderr and stdout.

